 "remarks": "A rare opportunity to own a truly unique residence in a granite and limestone estate of historic significance, just moments from the heart of downtown New Canaan. Set on three beautifully landscaped acres, Stepping Stones is a distinguished community of only eight bespoke condominiums offering an impressive castle like setting with exceptional period craftsmanship throughout. This spacious 2,090sf residence features 3 bedrooms and 2.1 bathrooms, soaring ceilings, European millwork and distinctive Hope steel windows. The updated kitchen opens to beautiful hardwood flooring that continues through the living room and two bedrooms. The living room is highlighted by a fireplace and impressive architectural details. The primary suite features slate flooring, a private full bathroom and built in closets. Step outside to an amazing private rear patio surrounded by the beautifully maintained grounds, creating a peaceful setting for relaxing or entertaining. Rich in character and architectural detail, this one of a kind residence offers a combination of history, charm and convenience that is rarely found.",
